Copyright (c) 2026 Scott Horn. Licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

TouchGuard was created by SyntaxSoft in 2016
(https://github.com/thesyntaxinator/TouchGuard). That project had no licence
file. TouchGuard 2.x is a new Swift implementation of the same idea and keeps
the command-line options of the original tool. It contains none of the
original C source. The original code is preserved, unchanged, in this
repository's history under the tag `legacy-final` and the branch `legacy`.

Thank you to SyntaxSoft for the original TouchGuard.

Third-party software
