The download (Developer ID) version of TouchGuard includes Sparkle
(https://sparkle-project.org), Copyright (c) 2006-2013 Andy Matuschak and
others, under the MIT License, with components under BSD-style and other
permissive licences. Its full licence text ships inside the app at
TouchGuard.app/Contents/Resources/Sparkle-LICENSE.txt and is kept in this
repository at TouchGuardApp/Licenses/Sparkle-LICENSE.txt.

The Mac App Store version contains no third-party code.
